   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Abstract image featuring dynamic blue and purple light patterns resembling energy waves or data streams. The composition is dark, creating a dramatic effect.  The style is modern and abstract, suitable for use as a background or design element in various media.  This image is versatile and could be used for technology, science, or energy-related projects, or as a background for websites, presentations, or marketing materials.</rdf:li>
